0.09 0.24 0.36 rg BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 620.4000000000001 Tm (2. Project Objective) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 600.4000000000001 Tm (This project aims to develop and evaluate an agentic Text-to-SQL system that helps users with limited SQL) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 589.5000000000001 Tm (expertise retrieve reliable answers from relational databases through natural-language questions. We study how) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 578.6000000000001 Tm (agentic system design can improve both query correctness and computational efficiency, rather than focusing) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 567.7000000000002 Tm (only on SQL generation.) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 553.8000000000002 Tm (Intended users and needs. Our primary users are business and operations analysts who regularly need data but) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 542.9000000000002 Tm (may not know the database schema or how to write complex SQL. Junior data analysts are secondary users who may) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 532.0000000000002 Tm (need support with joins, aggregations, and debugging. These users need: \(1\) accessible natural-language) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 521.1000000000003 Tm (querying; \(2\) automatic discovery of relevant tables, columns, and PK/FK relationships; \(3\) reliable handling) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 510.2000000000003 Tm (of complex analyses and SQL errors; and \(4\) timely answers at reasonable inference cost.) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 496.3000000000003 Tm (We first build an agentic baseline that explores schemas, generates and executes SQL, and debugs failed) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 485.4000000000003 Tm (queries. We then evaluate two targeted improvements:) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 471.50000000000034 Tm (- Query Planner: Decompose complex analytical questions into logical steps before SQL generation.) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 457.60000000000036 Tm (- Adaptive Controller: Route simpler questions to a normal model and harder questions to a stronger reasoning) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 446.7000000000004 Tm (model.) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 432.8000000000004 Tm (Research questions) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 418.90000000000043 Tm (- RQ1: Does explicit query planning improve Text-to-SQL execution accuracy, especially on moderate and) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 408.00000000000045 Tm (challenging queries?) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 394.1000000000005 Tm (- RQ2: Can adaptive model routing maintain strong query accuracy while reducing latency, token usage, and) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 383.2000000000005 Tm (estimated model cost compared with always using a strong model?) Tj ET
0.09 0.24 0.36 rg BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 359.3000000000005 Tm (3. Motivation and Challenges) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 339.3000000000005 Tm (Self-service analytics is difficult when users must understand unfamiliar schemas, identify correct joins,) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 328.40000000000055 Tm (express multi-step calculations, and fix SQL errors. For example, a retail analyst may ask: "Which three) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 317.50000000000057 Tm (products had the largest sales increase between 2022 and 2023?" Answering this requires finding the right sales) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 306.6000000000006 Tm (and product data, aggregating by year, matching products, calculating differences, and ranking results.) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 292.7000000000006 Tm (A Text-to-SQL agent can make this workflow more accessible, but it may choose incorrect tables or columns,) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 281.80000000000064 Tm (misunderstand relationships, generate logically wrong SQL that still executes, or fail to recover from) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 270.90000000000066 Tm (execution errors. Stronger models and additional reasoning may help, but increase cost and response time. The) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 260.0000000000007 Tm (challenge is to determine which agentic mechanisms improve answer reliability and whether their computational) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 249.10000000000068 Tm (overhead is justified.) Tj ET
0.09 0.12 0.16 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 49 235.20000000000067 Tm (The design connects concrete user needs to agent features:) Tj ET
